WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.400
A recorded voice: here a vocal take from the Music folder, dragged onto the timeline.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:14.600
Raw vocals need a few steps to sound finished. LYNX has them in one menu.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.600
Right-click the track, Clean voice, with noise reduction.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:27.800
That adds a chain: noise reduction, EQ, gate, de-esser and compressor, already set.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:33.800
For pitch, add LYNX Tune from More effects. It follows the song's key.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:39.600
LYNX Tune shows the note it hears. The de-esser, Hush, softens hard S sounds.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.600
Finally a little reverb: turn the Reverb knob up, not too far.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:52.600
Clean, in tune, and in the same room as the music.
